      "type": "feature",
      "img": "icons/magic/death/skeleton-skull-soul-blue.webp",
      "system": {
        "active": true,
        "description": "<p class=\"feature\">The balor explodes when it dies.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Dexterity Saving Throw:</em> DC 20, each creature in a 30-foot Emanation originating from the balor.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Failure:</em> 31 (9d6) Fire plus 31 (9d6) Force damage.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Failure or Success:</em> If the balor dies outside the Abyss, it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in the Abyss.</p>",
        "ruleElements": []
